User Experience Flow
When users open the website, they see a welcome screen titled **“World Explorer – Discover Countries Around the World.”** Background travel-themed music begins playing.

Users scroll through the page to discover countries one by one. Each country section appears with animations such as fade-ins, sliding cards, or zoom effects.

Visual Design
The website should include a world map theme, country flags, and colorful travel-inspired backgrounds. Each country card should display famous landmark images.

Audio Experience
Soft travel-style background music should play throughout the website. Optional sound effects can play when users explore a new country.

Interactive Features

Country Cards
Each country appears as a card containing its flag, capital, and famous landmark images.

Search Feature
Users can search for any country.

Random Country Generator
A button that displays a random country and its details.

Continent Filters
Users can filter countries by continent such as Asia, Europe, Africa, and America.

Hover Animations
Country cards slightly enlarge or glow when hovered.

Interactive World Map
Users can click on a country on the map to see its information.

Favorite Countries
Users can save their favorite countries.

Goal
The goal of this website is to create an engaging and visually rich learning platform where users can explore many countries, learn about their capitals and origins, and discover famous landmarks through images and interactive features.
